flowchart TD
    A[Upload File] --> B[MinIO / S3 Blob Storage]
    A --> C[MySQL Document Record: UNSTART]
    C --> D[POST /api/v1/datasets/<dataset_id>/documents/parse]
    D --> E[Redis Task Queue: ragflow_TASK_EXE_QUEUE]
    E --> F[Worker: rag/svr/task_executor.py]
    F --> G[DeepDoc Engine]
    G --> H[YOLO Layout Recognition]
    G --> I[PaddleOCR Recognition]
    G --> J[Table & Figure Extraction]
    H --> K[Text Chunks & Images]
    I --> K
    J --> K
    K --> L[ChunkTokenizer]
    L --> M[LLMBundle Embedding]
    M --> N[Elasticsearch / Infinity Vector Index]
    N --> O[MySQL Document Status: FINISHED 1.0]
